@param root: la radice dell'albero di espressione 
@return: il risultato dell'espressione matematica (float o Double)

Italian.back_translation:
It takes as input an expression tree (an instance of TreeNode), traverses it, and calculates the resulting mathematical expression. This expression tree supports the arithmetic operations: +, -, *, /, ^, %. 
@param root: the root of the expression tree 
@return: the result of the mathematical expression (float or Double)

